<http://data.silknow.org/object/10abf7b9-66bc-3d2b-8d2a-4fda98ec2af7/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Corset of blue silk trimmed at the top edge with a narrow band of machine-made lace. The corset reaches the top of the hips and is gored at the bust and hips. The corset is stiffened with whalebone and machine-stitched with an incised swivel latch to lock the busk fastening. There is a lace fastening at the back. Boned at the centre front, back and diagonally from the side to back and sides to front. The boning is hand-stitched into place. Metal eyelets. Lined with cotton twill."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/10abf7b9-66bc-3d2b-8d2a-4fda98ec2af7> .

